      "text": "September 2022 article: 305 apartments, 48 single-family homes with 27 ADUs, 25 townhomes, 50 senior independent living residences, a 110-bed assisted living facility and a 229-room hotel; about 51,000 sq ft of ground-floor retail in the apartment building.",
